# MedSync Health, Inc.
## International Expansion Strategy
**Document ID**: STRAT-007
**Classification**: Internal - Confidential
**Last Updated**: January 2025

---

## Executive Summary

MedSync will expand internationally beginning in 2026, targeting the UK and Canada as initial markets. By 2029, international revenue is targeted at 20% of total ARR ($180M). This phased approach minimizes risk while establishing global presence.

---

## Strategic Rationale

### Why Expand Internationally

| Factor | Rationale |
|--------|-----------|
| Market Size | $9.3B addressable outside US |
| Growth Diversification | Reduce US concentration risk |
| Customer Demand | Inbound requests from global orgs |
| Competitive Defense | Pre-empt competitor expansion |
| Valuation | Global footprint increases multiple |

### Why Now

| Factor | Status |
|--------|--------|
| US Market Position | Established leadership |
| Product Maturity | Platform proven at scale |
| Financial Strength | Series D runway |
| Team Capability | Ready to scale |
| Market Timing | Healthcare IT adoption accelerating globally |

