## Risk Management

### Key Risks

| Risk | Probability | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|-------------|--------|------------|
| Slow market adoption | Medium | High | Phased approach, local partnerships |
| Regulatory complexity | Medium | Medium | Local expertise, compliance investment |
| Talent acquisition | High | Medium | Competitive comp, remote options |
| Currency fluctuation | Medium | Low | Natural hedge, pricing |
| Integration challenges | Medium | Medium | Pre-market technical work |

### Contingency Plans

| Scenario | Trigger | Response |
|----------|---------|----------|
| Market underperformance | <50% target at 18 mo | Scale back, reassess |
| Competitive pressure | Major competitor entry | Accelerate differentiation |
| Regulatory change | Significant new requirements | Compliance investment |

